Z_text","label":"ggMQ6LGN9eZ_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money Back Guarantee&nbsp;&amp; Instant Refunds</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggt5kw7aViW_text","label":"ggt5kw7aViW_text","default":"<p>With <strong>up to three full months</strong> to experience MenoMate, you’ll have plenty of time to see real improvements—from fewer hot flashes and better sleep to a flatter midsection. If you’re not completely satisfied, just reach out for a<strong> fast, no-questions-asked refund</strong>. We want your only surprise to be how quickly you feel like yourself again.</p>"}],
